  offerLine: I'm thinking... of staying. Keep worm pie... on the menu. Three closings. I need to know... I can rely on you. I'm slow. It might be gone... by the time I arrive.
  activeLine: Three closings... with pie... on the board. No rush. I never do.
  readyLine: You didn't take it off. Not once. Nobody's ever... waited for me. Here. For your garden.
  doneLine: It's nice... here.
